    "answer": "shameless/shameless-person",
    "mnemonic": "<ja>恥</ja> is a \"disgrace.\" If you <ja>知らず</ja> then you don't know something. In this case, you don't know disgrace, and a person who doesn't know disgrace is a <vocabulary>shameless person</vocabulary>, because they don't care what disgraces them and what doesn't.",
